{
  "title": "RPO / RTO · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "재해 복구에서 허용할 데이터 손실과 복구 시간을 표현한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>RPO <span class=\"full-name\">(Recovery Point Objective)</span> / RTO <span class=\"full-name\">(Recovery Time Objective)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">Recovery Point Objective</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">Recovery Time Objective</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#backup-and-restore\">Backup and Restore</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#pilot-light\">Pilot Light</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#warm-standby\">Warm Standby</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#multi-site-active-active\">Multi-site Active-Active</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#failover-failback-and-testing\">Failover, Failback and Testing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>운영·비용</span><span>44 / 62</span></div><h1>RPO <span class=\"full-name\">(Recovery Point Objective)</span> / RTO <span class=\"full-name\">(Recovery Time Objective)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a>는 장애 시 허용할 데이터 손실의 시간 범위이고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>는 서비스를 복구할 때까지 허용하는 시간이다. 두 수치는 Business 요구이며 Backup 주기·복제·Compute 준비·전환 절차를 결정한다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a> 5분은 5분 안에 복구한다는 뜻이 아니다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>에는 데이터 복원뿐 아니라 Instance 시작, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>·Connection 전환, 검증·사용자 접근 회복까지 포함한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"장애 시점 전후의 목표\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>장애 시점 전후의 목표</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Data loss window</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Last recoverable point</strong><small>마지막 복원 가능 데이터</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a></strong><small>허용 데이터 손실 시간</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Failure time</strong><small>장애 발생 시점</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Recovery window</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Failure time</strong><small>장애 인지·복구 시작</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a></strong><small>허용 서비스 복구 시간</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Service restored</strong><small>사용자 기능 검증 완료</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a> 15분·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a> 2시간은 데이터 손실과 서비스 중단의 서로 다른 한도다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Strategy</th><th scope=\"col\">Ready state</th><th scope=\"col\">Relative recovery</th><th scope=\"col\">Relative cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#backup-and-restore\">Backup and Restore</a></td><td>Backup</td><td>가장 긴 편</td><td>낮음</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#pilot-light\">Pilot Light</a></td><td>핵심 데이터·최소 구성</td><td>Compute 준비 필요</td><td>중간 이하</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#warm-standby\">Warm Standby</a></td><td>축소된 전체 서비스</td><td>확장·전환</td><td>중간 이상</td></tr><tr><td>Active-Active</td><td>여러 위치에서 서비스</td><td>짧은 전환 목표</td><td>높음·복잡함</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"recovery-point-objective\"><h2>Recovery Point Objective<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>마지막 복구 가능한 데이터 시점과 장애 시점의 간격이다. 1시간마다 Backup하면 최악 손실이 그 이상이 될 수 있어 Backup 완료·복제 지연까지 고려한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a> 0 요구는 동기 복제와 장애 모델의 조건을 엄격히 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"recovery-time-objective\"><h2>Recovery Time Objective<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>장애부터 기능 회복까지의 목표 시간이다. Backup Download·Volume 초기화·DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Restore·앱 시작·검증이 포함된다. 문서상의 서비스 Failover 시간만으로 전체 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>를 계산하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"backup-and-restore\"><h2>Backup and Restore<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#backup-and-restore\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>평소 Backup을 보관하고 장애 때 Infrastructure와 데이터를 Restore한다. 대기 비용은 낮지만 복구 시간이 길어질 수 있다. Infrastructure as Code·자동 Restore로 반복 가능한 절차를 준비한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"pilot-light\"><h2>Pilot Light<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#pilot-light\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>핵심 데이터·최소 구성은 복구 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>에서 계속 유지하고 앱 Compute는 필요할 때 확장한다. 데이터 복제와 Capacity 확보·배포 준비를 점검한다. 완전히 꺼진 Backup만 보관하는 방식과 준비 수준이 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"warm-standby\"><h2>Warm Standby<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#warm-standby\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>축소된 전체 서비스 환경을 복구 위치에서 운영한다. 장애 때 Capacity를 늘리고 Traffic을 전환한다. 평상시 실제 요청·검증으로 작동을 확인할 수 있지만 대기 비용이 더 든다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"multi-site-active-active\"><h2>Multi-site Active-Active<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#multi-site-active-active\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>여러 위치가 동시에 요청을 처리한다. 복구 지연을 줄일 수 있지만 데이터 충돌·일관성·Routing·남은 위치의 Capacity 설계가 복잡하다. 모든 Database가 자동 Multi-writer를 지원하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"failover-failback-and-testing\"><h2>Failover, Failback and Testing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#failover-failback-and-testing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Failover는 복구 환경 전환이고 Failback은 원래 환경으로 돌아가는 절차다. 전환 중 새 쓰기·복제 방향·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> Cache를 다룬다. 정기 Game Day와 Restore 시험으로 목표 수치를 실제 측정한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a> 15분·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a> 4시간인 내부 도구와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a> 거의 0·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a> 수분인 결제 시스템은 다른 DR 비용을 정당화한다. 먼저 목표를 정하고 복제·대기 환경을 선택한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a> 5분은 복구를 5분 안에 끝낸다는 뜻이 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/reliability-pillar/plan-for-disaster-recovery-dr.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">wellarchitected/latest/reliability-pillar/plan-for-disaster-recovery-dr.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q001\" data-question=\"Q001\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q001</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application must remain available during a prolonged outage of the entire Seoul Region. What is the minimum scope for replication?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A different AWS Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A different subnet in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A different Availability Zone in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A different ENI in the same Availability Zone</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 분리는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 안의 장애를 다룬다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 수준 장애는 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 복제와 전환이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q004\" data-question=\"Q004\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q004</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q004/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Cost optimization and reliability requirements appear to conflict. What is the best architectural decision?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Increase only the EC2 instance size</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Evaluate business RPO and RTO requirements alongside cost</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Replicate every system across multiple Regions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q004\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Always choose the least expensive single-AZ deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a>는 여러 기둥의 요구와 균형을 함께 평가한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q023\" data-question=\"Q023\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q023</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q023/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants DNS responses for a domain to switch to another Region based on health checks. Which service is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS KMS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q023\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 헬스 체크와 장애 조치 라우팅 정책을 쓴다. 클라이언트 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a> 때문에 전환은 즉시 완료되지 않을 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q078\" data-question=\"Q078\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q078</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q078/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workload allows at most 15 minutes of data loss and must be restored within 2 hours. Which values correspond to those requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RPO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">RPO of 15 minutes and RTO of 2 hours</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RTO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">RTO of 15 minutes and RPO of 2 hours</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a>는 데이터 손실 허용 시점, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>는 서비스 복구까지 허용 시간이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q093\" data-question=\"Q093\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q093</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q093/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO targets must be established for a database recovery strategy that withstands a Region outage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery time objective (RTO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the network ACL rule number</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery point objective (RPO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The color of the AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The length of an Elastic IP address name</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, C</strong> · 허용 데이터 손실과 복구 시간을 목표로 정해야 복제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 전략을 선택할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">이전 용어 <b>Route Table</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">다음 용어 <b>S3</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
